flowchart LR
 R["RESEARCH<br/>Public sources / Profile<br/>Facts + source URLs"] --> S["PLAN<br/>Rank approaches<br/>Keep reasons + alternatives"]
 S --> W["WRITE<br/>Message, page or call turn<br/>Facts + story + history"]
 W --> Q{"QUALITY<br/>Rules + consistency"}
 Q -->|pass| T["CONTACT<br/>revel8 API only<br/>Stable keys + touch budget"]
 Q -.->|bounded correction| W
 T --> E["OBSERVE<br/>Receipt + raw events<br/>Reply + cumulative touches"]
 E --> A["ADAPT<br/>Interpret reaction<br/>Continue, close or stop"]
 A -.->|next decision + lessons| S
 classDef default fill:#f3f6fa,stroke:#c0ccd9,color:#152638,stroke-width:1px;
 classDef guard fill:#e4f3ef,stroke:#287d6a,color:#154e43,stroke-width:2px;
 class Q guard;
